{"id": "1529382823562051675", "channel_id": "1529382823562051675", "author_id": "1485258210209435701", "author_name": "morimensstaff06", "content": "**V2.5.3 战斗吧守密人**\n\n地点：弥萨格大学-公共训练场⚔️\n对手：已为你随机匹配到蚀灭·萝坦\n敌方技能：力量型\n我方技能：打击、防御、？？？、？？？\n\n对战蚀灭·萝坦，守密人准备用哪些卡牌取胜呢？欢迎在评论区分享你的策略！\n无论胜与败，本节训练课都将为你结算「银芯×200」奖励。\n\n——✦——✦—— ✦✦✦ ——✦——✦——\n\n**V2.5.3 Ready to Fight, Keeper?**\n\nLocation: Mythag University - Public Training Ground ⚔️\nOpponent: [Randomly Matched] Lotan: Cetarchon\nEnemy Skills: Power-type\nYour Skills: Strike, Defend, ???, ???\n\nLotan: Cetarchon is coming for you. Which cards will you play to survive, Keeper? Drop your strategy in the comments! 👇\nWin or lose, clear this session and claim your Silver ×200.\n\n——✦——✦—— ✦✦✦ ——✦——✦——\n\n**V2.5.3 겨루어라, 수호자여**\n\n장소: 미사그 대학 - 공공 훈련장⚔️\n상대: 침식·로탄과 랜덤 매칭되었습니다\n적 스킬: 힘 타임 \n아군 스킬: 타격, 방어, ???, ???\n\n침식·로탄을 상대로, 수호자는 어떤 카드로 승리를 거머쥐게 될까요?\n댓글을 통해 여러분의 전략을 공유해주세요!\n승패와 관계없이, 이번 훈련 수업을 완료하시면 보상으로 '은심 × 200' 을 지급해 드립니다.\n\n<@&1440553558238953482>", "timestamp": "2026-07-22T07:01:19.696000+00:00", "flags": 256, "thread_id": "1529382823562051675", "reactions": [{"emoji": "🏳️‍🌈", "emoji_id": null, "count": 7}, {"emoji": "Aurita_pinch", "emoji_id": "1468258028271833119", "count": 2}], "attachments": [{"id": "1529382824065630321", "filename": "CN.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 987703, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1529382823562051675/1529382824065630321/CN.jpg?ex=6a61bc3f&is=6a606abf&hm=d5300086765649da56b2fd446b15ca1319bb18df63d51ba66016f879972e5539&"}, {"id": "1529382824518619286", "filename": "EN.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 990018, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1529382823562051675/1529382824518619286/EN.jpg?ex=6a61bc3f&is=6a606abf&hm=205261a2f3675842b8cf8ac4b6adf2bb50e3f0656d0ca8a1b26ff143468c53ed&"}, {"id": "1529382824937787432", "filename": "KR.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 982935, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/152938282356205167